1
00:00:00,933 --> 00:00:05,467
Presenting the heir
of Dynasty Hotel...

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,133
My daughter,

3
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:11,300
Hannah Montano...

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,267
Song!

5
00:00:12,267 --> 00:00:19,333
- [BRIGHT MUSIC PLAYING]
- [ALL APPLAUDING]

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,233
Hannah!

7
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:32,500
Thank you, Father.

8
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,400
Hey, you guys. I'm still me.
I'm still your silly old Hannah.

9
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,000
- [GIGGLES]
- [HANNAH] Come on.

10
00:00:41,567 --> 00:00:42,533
[STAFF GIGGLING]

11
00:00:42,533 --> 00:00:44,467
But, on a serious note...

12
00:00:45,433 --> 00:00:48,033
I still want to thank
all of you.

13
00:00:48,667 --> 00:00:50,567
I've learned a lot from you.

14
00:00:50,567 --> 00:00:56,033
I saw how dedicated
and hardworking you all are.

15
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,467
And because of that,

16
00:00:59,433 --> 00:01:02,533
Dynasty Hotel will no longer
shut down!

17
00:01:02,533 --> 00:01:04,500
[ALL CHEERING, APPLAUDING]

18
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,700
You guys will get
to keep your jobs!

19
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,633
Hannah!

20
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,667
Thank you, Ha--

21
00:01:16,067 --> 00:01:17,567
Madam Hannah.

22
00:01:18,467 --> 00:01:20,800
I'm sorry for everything
I've done to you.

23
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,267
[CHUCKLING]

24
00:01:22,267 --> 00:01:27,100
Madam, just call me Hannah.
It's not like we're strangers.

25
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,067
- [CHUCKLES]
- But for you,

26
00:01:29,067 --> 00:01:32,067
we will now be conducting
anger management workshops

27
00:01:32,067 --> 00:01:34,767
so we can avoid
any more slapping incidents

28
00:01:34,767 --> 00:01:36,633
lest we get reported
for breaking labor laws.

29
00:01:36,633 --> 00:01:38,833
- Is it really necessary?
- Absolutely.

30
00:01:38,833 --> 00:01:40,200
[MURMURING]

31
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,767
You're no different.
You're two-faced.

32
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,433
- See?
- Sorry, friend.

33
00:01:43,433 --> 00:01:45,367
- Peace. Love you!
- Alright.

34
00:01:45,367 --> 00:01:47,067
- Love you!
- [GIGGLES]

35
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:49,600
[SABRINA] Can I give you a hug?

36
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:51,200
- Of course!
- Thanks!

37
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:54,567
Oh! Hup! [GIGGLING]

38
00:01:54,567 --> 00:01:55,600
Thank you.

39
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:58,267
- [ALL APPLAUDING]
- [BRIGHT MUSIC CONTINUES]

40
00:01:58,267 --> 00:01:59,467
- Sorry, friend.
- It's all good!

41
00:01:59,467 --> 00:02:00,700
- I love you!
- [HANNAH GIGGLING]

42
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:02,433
You look gorgeous!

43
00:02:02,433 --> 00:02:05,200
You look so much
like a princess! Gosh!

44
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:10,833
- [EXCITED CHATTER, APPLAUSE]
- [MUSIC TURNS SULLEN]

45
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:13,467
Hannah, we have to go now.

46
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:15,533
Oh. Yes, Father.

47
00:02:17,233 --> 00:02:22,267
- [SABRINA] Bye-bye!
- [APPLAUDING]

48
00:02:22,267 --> 00:02:24,867
(In Korean) We love you!
We love you!

49
00:02:24,867 --> 00:02:26,533
Do your best, alright?

50
00:02:26,533 --> 00:02:28,267
Bye, Princess Hannah!

51
00:02:30,233 --> 00:02:33,567
I want to go to Korea too!

52
00:02:33,567 --> 00:02:40,467
[SULLEN MUSIC CONTINUES]
